{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01126","headline":"相和歌辞 短歌行二首 二 · 白居易","name":"相和歌辞 短歌行二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世人求富贵，多爲身嗜欲。\n盛衰不自由，得失常相逐。\n问君少年日，苦学将干禄。\n负笈尘中游，抱书雪前宿。\n布衾不周体，藜茄才充腹。\n三十登宦途，五十被朝服。\n奴温已挟纩，马肥初食粟。\n未敢议欢游，尚爲名检束。\n耳目聋暗後，堂上调丝竹。\n牙齿缺落时，盘中堆酒肉。\n彼来此已去，外余中不足。\n少壮与荣华，相避如寒燠。\n青云去地远，白日终天速。\n从古无奈何，短歌听一曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}